  "notes": [
    "Every artifact is a LiteRT-LM .litertlm package pinned to an immutable Hugging Face revision.",
    "sha256 is the file's Git-LFS oid as reported by the Hub API; verify_catalog.py --online re-reads it.",
    "contextTokens is PER MODEL and the runtime must clamp to it: MedGemma's build exports a 2048-entry KV cache, so the engine's global 4096 would overrun it.",
